Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 11:17:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD visual-mode pane selection so terminal users can yank
 focused-pane text

Terminal command mode supports character, line, and block visual selections in either pane. The focused pane supplies the selected rows or chat text, terminal adapters copy through OSC52, and escape handling waits for full control sequences so arrow keys can extend selections.
